# Allow-list: the default context would include a multi-gigabyte .lake and the experiment results.
# Keep in sync with the COPY instructions in experiments/Dockerfile.
*
!lean-toolchain
!lakefile.toml
!lake-manifest.json
!GeneralizationLinter.lean
!GeneralizationLinter/
!experiments/run.py
# Re-exclude what .gitignore excludes. These scratch files are not in the repository, so shipping them
# would make the image's contents differ from the revision GL_REVISION names.
GeneralizationLinter/**/_*
**/.DS_Store
